@baseUrl = https://localhost:7038
@token = paste-jwt-here
@ticketId = 1
@assetId = 1
@uploadId = paste-upload-id-here
@attachmentId = 1

### Ticket queue (admin or agent)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ticket details (creator, admin, or agent)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a portal ticket
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "РќРµ СЂР°Р±РѕС‚Р°РµС‚ VPN",
  "description": "РќРµ СѓРґР°РµС‚СЃСЏ РїРѕРґРєР»СЋС‡РёС‚СЊСЃСЏ Рє РєРѕСЂРїРѕСЂР°С‚РёРІРЅРѕР№ СЃРµС‚Рё.",
  "typeId": 1,
  "priority": "High",
  "customFieldsData": {}
}

### Create a repair ticket (admin or agent; asset must be in stock or in use)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Р РµРјРѕРЅС‚ РЅРѕСѓС‚Р±СѓРєР°",
  "description": "РќРµ РІРєР»СЋС‡Р°РµС‚СЃСЏ РїРѕСЃР»Рµ РѕР±РЅРѕРІР»РµРЅРёСЏ.",
  "typeId": 5,
  "priority": "High",
  "assetId": {{assetId}}
}

### Update a ticket (admin or agent)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "priority": "Critical",
  "customFieldsData": {
    "impact": "department"
  }
}

### Assign a ticket to an active support engineer (admin or agent)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/assign
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "assigneeId": 2
}

### Change ticket status (admin or agent)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "statusId": 2
}

### Close a repair ticket
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "statusId": 5,
  "repairResolution": "Р—Р°РјРµРЅРµРЅ Р±Р»РѕРє РїРёС‚Р°РЅРёСЏ, СѓСЃС‚СЂРѕР№СЃС‚РІРѕ РїСЂРѕРІРµСЂРµРЅРѕ.",
  "repairOutcome": "ReturnToExploitation"
}

### Manually escalate a ticket (creator or assignee)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/escalate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get escalation rules (admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/escalation-rules
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Enable manual escalation for a ticket type (admin)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/escalation-rules/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "onSlaBreach": true,
  "onManual": true,
  "isActive": true
}

### Read ticket messages (creator, admin, or agent)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add a public message
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "messageBody": "Р”РѕР±Р°РІРёР» СЃРІРµРґРµРЅРёСЏ Рѕ РїСЂРѕР±Р»РµРјРµ.",
  "isInternal": false
}

### Upload a file (returns a temporary upload id valid for 24 hours)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/attachments
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=ticket-upload
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

--ticket-upload
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="vpn-details.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

VPN connection fails with error 809.
--ticket-upload--

### Attach an uploaded file to a message
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "messageBody": "Добавил журнал ошибки.",
  "attachments": ["{{uploadId}}"]
}

### Download an attachment belonging to a ticket message
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/attachments/{{attachmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add an internal message (admin or agent)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "messageBody": "Р—Р°РїСЂРѕСЃРёР»Рё РґРёР°РіРЅРѕСЃС‚РёРєСѓ Сѓ РІС‚РѕСЂРѕР№ Р»РёРЅРёРё.",
  "isInternal": true
}

### Asset ticket history with optional filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assets/{{assetId}}/tickets?statusId=3&dateFrom=2026-01-01
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Read service desk head (admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ticket-configuration/service-desk-head
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Set service desk head to an active support engineer (admin)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/ticket-configuration/service-desk-head
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "userId": 2
}

### Error path: missing ticket
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/2147483647
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
